From f77939e617f69ea8abf7e678e2d24612a440f89f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:34:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Port to SFML 3

- sf::Vertex is an aggregate, sf::Text needs its font at construction
- Quads no longer exist: draw each quad as two triangles
- LineStrip is scoped (and LinesStrip was a typo), rotations use
  sf::degrees, rect members are position/size, transform calls take vectors
- Sample: new window, event, font and texture APIs
- CMake: require SFML 3, link the SFML:: targets, CMake 3.22

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019DZ2BoCqi9U7VotnpVjRMp
